OL,3,APrince William meets Burnham on first
OL,4,ADowning Street visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales walked up Downing
OL,7,FStreet for the first time, as he
OL,8,Fvisited Prime Minister Andy Burnham.
OL,10,FBehind the black door of No 10, Prince
OL,11,FWilliam is expected to talk to Burnham
OL,12,Fabout issues including homelessness,
OL,13,Fwith both the prime minister and the
OL,14,Fprince committed to tackling the
OL,15,Fproblem.
OL,17,FThe two men have met before, such as
OL,18,Fthe Omani state visit last month, where
OL,19,Fthey both attended the state banquets
OL,20,Fat Windsor Castle.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
