OL,3,APrince William meets Burnham on first
OL,4,ADowning Street visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut this is the first visit that Prince
OL,7,FWilliam has made to meet a serving
OL,8,Fprime minister in Downing Street - and
OL,9,Fthe first senior royal to visit No 10
OL,10,Fsince the late Queen Elizabeth II came
OL,11,Fhere in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
